# Abyssal Gorestalker: it is on the battlefield as its trigger resolves, so Bot1 (with a Memnite and an Ornithopter besides) may choose the Gorestalker itself as one of its two creatures (CR 701.21a, 603.4):
# it sacrifices the Gorestalker and the Memnite and keeps the Ornithopter. Bot2 has only a Phyrexian Walker, fewer than two, so it sacrifices that one and nothing else (CR 101.4). Bot1's graveyard holds the Gorestalker, the Memnite and the sacrificed Black Lotus.
